{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>The son of my house shall inherit me.</b> Even though You will give me seed in the end, as You said (Genesis 12:7), <b>לְזַרְעֲךָ אֶתֵּן אֶת הָאָרֶץ הַזֹּאת</b> (\"To your seed I will give this land\"), nevertheless the son will remain young and unfit to manage property, and the son of my house who manages it will be the one who inherits, as usually happens."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:13.306812529Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}